# NOTE: assets/videos/ and assets/posters/ ARE committed so the site is self-contained.
# They total a few hundred MB. If the repo gets heavy, consider Git LFS:
#   git lfs install && git lfs track "assets/videos/*.mp4"
# or host the videos on a CDN and point js/data.js at the CDN URLs.
